#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_multiple_objects.rst:5
msgid "Select multiple objects"
msgstr "选择多个对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_multiple_objects.rst:7
msgid ""
"As many CAD tools, many objects (`elements`_, `conductors`_, `text fields`_,"
" `basic objects`_ and `pictures`_) from `workspace`_ can be selected in "
"QElectroTech at the same time."
msgstr ""
"与许多 CAD 工具一样，许多对象(`元件 <elements_>`_，`导体 <conductors_>`_，`文本字段 <text "
"fields_>`_，`基本对象 <basic objects_>`_ 和 `图片 <pictures_>`_ 从。 `工作区 "
"<workspace_>`_ 可以同时在QElectroTech中选择。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_multiple_objects.rst:11
msgid "Select multiple objects using keyboard and mouse"
msgstr "使用键盘和鼠标选择多个对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_multiple_objects.rst:13
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows selecting multiple objects from the `workspace`_, "
"combining the use of keyboard and mouse."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中选择多个对象，结合使用键盘和鼠标。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_multiple_objects.rst:16
msgid "`Select`_ the first object."
msgstr "`选择 <Select_>`_ 第一个对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_multiple_objects.rst:17
msgid "Press ``Ctrl``."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl`` (中文(简体) )."

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_multiple_objects.rst:18
msgid "`Select`_ the rest of objects without releasing ``Ctrl``."
msgstr "`选择 <Select_>`_ 其他对象而不释放 ``Ctrl``."

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_multiple_objects.rst:23
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech schema"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech计划"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_multiple_objects.rst:26
msgid "Select multiple objects by selecting area"
msgstr "通过选择区域选择多个对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_multiple_objects.rst:28
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows selecting all objects from an area using the mouse to "
"select the desired area."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用鼠标从一个区域中选择所有对象来选择想要的区域。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_multiple_objects.rst:30
msgid ""
"Left click on the initial point from the rectangular area to be selected and"
" displace the mouse without releasing up to the end point."
msgstr "左键单击从矩形区域选择的初始点，并替换鼠标而不释放至终点 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_multiple_objects.rst:35
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech selecting on workspace"
msgstr "图：工作空间上的QElectroTech选择"
